   "source": [
    "# Reproduction: On the Epistemic Uncertainty of Overparametrized Neural Networks\n",
    "\n",
    "**Paper**: David Rügamer, ICML 2026 — [arXiv:2605.25234](https://arxiv.org/abs/2605.25234)\n",
    "\n",
    "This notebook reproduces all 4 major claims from the paper:\n",
    "1. Weight-splitting non-identifiability via simplex constraints\n",
    "2. EU = tr(Cov(w|D)) captures persistent parameter uncertainty\n",
    "3. Dirichlet posterior with α=(p+1)/2 and Theorem 1 moments\n",
    "4. Non-degenerate posterior as n → ∞\n",
    "\n",
    "**Runtime**: ~15-20 min on T4 GPU"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
